OL,3,GNEWSAHospitality a lifeline for
OL,4,Aflood-hit non-league club
OL,5,
OL,6,FA non-league football club that is
OL,7,Fregularly hit by flooding says
OL,8,Finvesting in its hospitality offering
OL,9,Fhas been a financial lifeline.
OL,11,FBelper Town's ground sits close to the
OL,12,FRiver Derwent and the clean-up and
OL,13,Fflood defences have been a huge expense
OL,14,Fto the club for years.
OL,16,FThe hospitality lounge has proved a
OL,17,Fhelpful source of income and was
OL,18,Frecognised by online reviewer, The
OL,19,FPadded Seat, as the best "hidden gem"
OL,20,Fof the 2025/26 season.
OL,23,APub: 15-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
