OL,3,GNEWSAHospitality a lifeline for
OL,4,Aflood-hit non-league club
OL,5,
OL,6,FAnnette Carter, a club volunteer of 30
OL,7,Fyears, said the flooding could be
OL,8,F"really bad", which was why they were
OL,9,Fworking to raise money for the club and
OL,10,Fwere "trying to do our little bit to
OL,11,Fhelp".
